{"text": "Old Behrman died in the hospital two days later. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That afternoon Sue came to the bed where Johnsy lay and put her arm around her. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I have something to tell you, she said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On the first stormy night, the janitor found Mister Behrman in his room, helpless with pain. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> His shoes and clothes were wet through and icy cold. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They could not imagine where he had been on such a terrible night. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then they found a lantern, still lit, and a ladder that had been dragged from its place. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There were also some brushes and a palette with green and yellow colors mixed on it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Look out of the window, dear, at the last ivy leaf on the wall. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Did you not wonder why it never moved when the wind blew. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Ah, darling, it is Behrmans masterpiece. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He painted it there the night the last leaf fell.", "alignment": {"characters": ["O", "l", "d", " ", "B", "e", "h", "r", "m", "a", "n", " ", "d", "i", "e", "d", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "h", "o", "s", "p", "i", "t", "a", "l", " ", "t", "w", "o", " ", "d", "a", "y", "s", " ", "l", "a", "t", "e", "r", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "a", "t", " ", "a", "f", "t", "e", "r", "n", "o", "o", "n", " ", "S", "u", "e", " ", "c", "a", "m", "e", " ", "t", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "e", "d", " ", "w", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "J", "o", "h", "n", "s", "y", " ", "l", "a", "y", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "p", "u", "t", " ", "h", "e", "r", " ", "a", "r", "m", " ", "a", "r", "o", "u", "n", "d", " ", "h", "e", "r", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", " ", "h", "a", "v", "e", " ", "s", "o", "m", "e", "t